<title>USA: USDA's Goldthwait in Brussels for talks with EU.</title>
<headline>USDA's Goldthwait in Brussels for talks with EU.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department General Sales Manager Chris Goldthwait is in Brussels meeting with European Union officials, USDA acting general sales manager Mary Chambliss said Thursday.</p>
<p>Chambliss said Goldthwait, who arrived in Brussels on Tuesday, was discussing ongoing negotiations in the Organization of Economic Cooperation and Development on export credit programs with EU officials. She said she had no further information on the agenda for the meetings.</p>
<p>Goldthwait departs Brussels later Thursday for visits to Geneva and Moscow, Chambliss said. He returns to Washington on Monday.</p>
